  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[mocha](https://www.npmjs.com/package/mocha) just published its new version 3.1.2.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Update :rocket:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      mocha\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      3.1.2\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **not covered** by your **current version range**.\n\nWithout accepting this pull request your project will work just like it did before. There might be a bunch of new features, fixes and perf improvements that the maintainers worked on for you though.\n\nI recommend you look into these changes and try to get onto the latest version of mocha.\nGiven that you have a decent test suite, a passing build is a strong indicator that you can take advantage of these changes by merging the proposed change into your project. Otherwise this branch is a great starting point for you to work on the update.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\n[GitHub Release](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/releases/tag/v3.1.2)\n\n<h1>3.1.2 / 2016-10-10</h1>\n\n\n<h2>\n<g-emoji alias=\"bug\" fallback-src=\"https://assets-cdn.github.com/images/icons/emoji/unicode/1f41b.png\" ios-version=\"6.0\">🐛</g-emoji> Bug Fix</h2>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/mochajs/mocha/issues/2528\">#2528</a>: Recovery gracefully if an <code>Error</code>'s <code>stack</code> property isn't writable ([<a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/boneskull\" class=\"user-mention\">@boneskull</a>])</li>\n</ul>\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 13 commits .\n- [`205e31b`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/205e31b0d43e395e5ae14c43d2a915254ef5f360) <code>Release v3.1.2</code>\n- [`2ceb9f2`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/2ceb9f2f39b1019194142d1e16239da477941091) <code>rebuild mocha.js [ci skip]</code>\n- [`e2274b4`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/e2274b4522a47aaf664781e8031e6c4547feea9d) <code>update CHANGELOG.md [ci skip]</code>\n- [`36184aa`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/36184aa78593772032988efa8845f3dc996b5c6f) <code>recover gracefully if stack is not writable; closes #2528</code>\n- [`5b83625`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/5b83625b229ba4667e5d687fba3d70134b6619f4) <code>Release v3.1.1</code>\n- [`138cadd`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/138cadd92ee2cb2da024826ee4d6d6eed328530f) <code>rebuild mocha.js [ci skip]</code>\n- [`db04179`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/db04179a0080ca9bce185581695642daca6bca4b) <code>update CHANGELOG for v3.1.1 [ci skip]</code>\n- [`2bb2b9f`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/2bb2b9fa35818db7a02e5068364b0c417436b1af) <code>lint the hell out of the javascript; closes #2525</code>\n- [`1c72d5c`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/1c72d5c006776a84d5e72240b7ee6a23675aadbf) <code>use Chrome for browser tests when run on macOS Sierra; closes #2524</code>\n- [`d62b2b8`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/d62b2b88befa12b74e7c8eb7f4fd9fb98e5eef58) <code>use semistandard</code>\n- [`b99e9b3`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/b99e9b3b0b71d623ffe4829fce24cddefc8cfe3a) <code>remove errant debug in test/integration/only.spec.js</code>\n- [`a40f28d`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/a40f28d0328c23605dae2a5ae863149429ce0343) <code>Merge branch 'fix-1417-multiple-done-calls' of https://github.com/frankleonrose/mocha into pull/2059</code>\n- [`2c52377`](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/commit/2c52377da981383fd23492edd54c1c4edbc3d3b0) <code>Fix #1417: Show actual error, not 'multiple calls to done()'</code>\n\nSee the [full diff](https://github.com/mochajs/mocha/compare/9915dfbc671f7f5d3cab55acde7356d839c1170c...205e31b0d43e395e5ae14c43d2a915254ef5f360).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
